{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bait Soul",
    "steam_appid": 3484100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/be14147ed84f409abfc96e76dbefe8e9.avif?t=1754407040\" width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.poster.avif?t=1754407040\" width=592 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.webm?t=1754407040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless One-Handed Play</strong><br>Weapons attack automatically, and the character is equipped with blink and sprint abilities, ensuring easy controls and intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Orb System</strong><br>Each weapon slot comes with its own unique attributes. Combine various weapons strategically to create the perfect loadout for any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Items</strong><br>Support items affect adjacent weapons, offering countless possibilities for creative combinations. Experience both strategy and fun in every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Beyond combat, discover exciting rooms and hidden chambers within the dungeon, adding a sense of adventure and exploration to the gameplay.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/be14147ed84f409abfc96e76dbefe8e9.avif?t=1754407040\" width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.poster.avif?t=1754407040\" width=592 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.webm?t=1754407040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless One-Handed Play</strong><br>Weapons attack automatically, and the character is equipped with blink and sprint abilities, ensuring easy controls and intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Orb System</strong><br>Each weapon slot comes with its own unique attributes. Combine various weapons strategically to create the perfect loadout for any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Items</strong><br>Support items affect adjacent weapons, offering countless possibilities for creative combinations. Experience both strategy and fun in every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Beyond combat, discover exciting rooms and hidden chambers within the dungeon, adding a sense of adventure and exploration to the gameplay.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Bait Soul&quot; is a top-down action roguelike game where players can freely combine various elements to create their ultimate combat style. Dive into the depths of the unknown, face countless formidable enemies, and ultimately break free from the tragic fate of being a &quot;Bait Soul.&quot;",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil",
